  "details": "[1489] Unexpected locomotion input is set while action menu is opened.\n\nWhen I opened Action menu with one hand while tilting stick, the input on another hand is preserved while action menu is opened.\n\nThis will move me unexpectedly.\n\nThis issue can be reproduced with Quest Touch series (Quest 2/3) or Pico4 with VD (Recognized as Touch series), but not with some other controller.\n\n**Steps to reproduce**\n\n1. Tilt left thumbstick forward to go forward and keep until step 3.\n\n2. Open Action menu with right menu button.\n\n3. Release left thumbstick.\n\n4. still moving forward.\n\nIf I tilt left in step 1, I move left in step 4 (instead of left turn).",
